<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>訂位成功</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/booking-step2.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/booking-success.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="booking-form-container">
            <div class="success-container">
                <div class="success-icon">✓</div>
                <h1 class="success-title">訂位成功</h1>
                <p class="success-message">感謝您的訂位，我們已收到您的訂位請求。</p>
                <div class="booking-id">
                    訂位編號：<%= bookingId %>
                </div>
                <p class="success-message">
                    我們將盡快確認您的訂位，並發送確認郵件至您的電子郵箱。<br>
                    如有任何問題，請隨時與我們聯繫。
                </p>
                <a href="/" class="home-button">返回首頁</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html> 